{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>You shall not bear a false report.</b> That one shall not bring forth from his heart a vain thing to spread a slander." "<b>And the sense of do not join your hand with the wicked.</b> To ally with him in false testimony, to do violence to the innocent — perhaps the poor man will do this to fill his lack."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:37:30.682262294Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}